  dct:description "The OWL class rendering of vocabulary-core-technicalservices: one class per concept, rdfs:subClassOf following skos:broader, each class grounded in its concept by dc:subject. Its root, Technical Services, sits under Services (core mappings: skos:broadMatch)."@en ;
